Sval: the default-browser question at launch asks in Sval's dialog

With Settings › General's check at launch on and Sval not the default,
BrowserGlue asks through DefaultBrowserCheck.prompt, which opens Firefox's
common dialog in Firefox's look. Every question Sval's chrome asks goes
through SvalDialog.sys.mjs, so this one does too, with Firefox's strings
and its answers handled as before. The prompt builds its dialog inside
the function BrowserGlue calls, so no added file can reach it.

